  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n10% of 24% of x is 240\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n10% of 24% of x = 240\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n10% of 24% of x = 240\n\n10% = 10/100 = 0.1\n\n24% = 24/100 = 0.24\n\n10% of 24% of x = 0.1 × 0.24 × x\n\n⇒ 0.1 × 0.24 × x = 240\n\n⇒ 0.024 × x = 240\n\n⇒ x = 240 / 0.024\n\n⇒ x = 10000\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (4).**",
